      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-03",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Protecting Businesses From Frivolous COVID Lawsuits Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill requires a specific jury instruction in a federal civil action for damages based on negligence arising from the transmission of COVID-19.</p><p>Specifically, a court must instruct the jury that negligence may not be found solely on the basis of holding oneself open for business.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-02-12T20:00:28Z"
      }
    ]
